The qustah icon sheet (qustah-v*.png) is drawn by qustah-ui-lib/tools/gen_filled_sheet.py from the icon sets below.
Which icon comes from which set: qustah-ui-lib/tools/qustah_icons.json. Icons drawn by hand pixel by pixel
(qustah-ui-lib/tools/qustah_drawn.json) are original, some modelled on pixelarticons and the Pixel Icon Library.

---

Solar Icon Set (the "solar:" icons, Bold style)
Copyright (c) 480 Design (https://www.figma.com/community/file/1166831539721848736)
Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes: the icons were redrawn as small bitmaps (14 - 30 px, every pixel on or off), placed, shrunk or thinned
slightly so they fit whole pixels, and a few pixels were edited by hand.

---

Material Design Icons (the "mdi:" icons)
Copyright (c) Pictogrammers (https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/)
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Changes: as above.

---

pixelarticons (some hand-drawn icons follow or copy these designs, e.g. sun)
Copyright (c) Gerrit Halfmann (https://github.com/halfmage/pixelarticons)
Licensed under the MIT License: https://github.com/halfmage/pixelarticons/blob/master/LICENSE

Changes: halved from the 24 px grid and placed on the 14 / 16 px cells.

---

Pixel Icon Library (some hand-drawn icons follow or copy these designs, e.g. paint-bucket)
Copyright (c) HackerNoon (https://github.com/hackernoon/pixel-icon-library)
Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes: redrawn as small bitmaps as above.
